                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, we reintroduced the Healthy SNAP Act, which will ensure that SNAP is used for nutritious foods, rather than junk foods and soda that contribute to long-term health issues. \n\nAmerica\u2019s obesity crisis is something that we can\u2019t ignore any longer if we\u2019re going to truly Make America Healthy Again.\n\nThank you to our co-sponsors: @RepAndyBiggsAZ, @RepCloudTX, @RepGosar, @RepGrothman, @RepMeuser, @RepMaryMiller, @RepDavid, @RepEliCrane",
